<title>MONACO: TENNIS-MONTE CARLO TENNIS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MONTE CARLO TENNIS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MONTE CARLO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the quarterfinals of the $2.3 million Monte Carlo men's tennis Open on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>12-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Christian Ruud (Norway) 6-2 6-0 Fabrice Santoro (France) beat Carlos Costa (Spain) 6-3 7-5  </p>
<p>6-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat 4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) 1-6</p>
<p>6-2 6-4</p>
<p>7-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Magnus Larsson (Sweden) 6-2 6-1</p>
</text>
